[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:4. An Exciting Trip]
[00:00.960]Passage 4 | 文章四
[00:02.390]An exciting trip. | 一次激动人心的旅行。
[00:05.165]I have just received a letter from my brother Tim. | 我刚刚收到我兄弟蒂姆的一封信。
[00:09.655]He is in Australia. | 他在澳大利亚。
[00:11.800]He has been there for six months. | 他已经在那里呆了六个月了。
[00:14.905]Tim is an engineer. | 蒂姆是一名工程师。
[00:18.015]He's working for a big firm and he has already visited a great number of different places in Australia. | 他正在一家大公司工作，并且已经参观了澳大利亚许多不同的地方。
[00:26.005]He has just bought an Australian car | 他刚刚买了一辆澳大利亚汽车
[00:29.545]and has gone to Alice Springs, a small town in the centre of Australia. | 并去了爱丽丝泉，那是澳大利亚中部的一个小镇。
[00:35.630]He will soon visit Darwin. | 他很快就会去达尔文。
[00:38.610]From there, he will fly to Perth. | 从那里，他将飞往珀斯。
[00:42.440]My brother has never been abroad before, so he is finding this trip very exciting. | 我哥哥以前从未出国过，所以他觉得这次旅行非常激动人心。